{
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "domId": "story-p-0",
      "index": 0,
      "imageId": 1,
      "role": 0,
      "roleName": "旁白",
      "avatar": "https://kolka-assets.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/assets/admin/933e5ff6-fd12-40fa-a405-bfff0b9d062e/roles-0-avatar.png?OSSAccessKeyId=LTAI5tABYqhJrazkVYiNk8hM&Expires=1787370228&Signature=yGQObbZ6mKjN6%2F9ozEDLClpOBkU%3D",
      "startTime": 0,
      "text": "夏天的太阳像个大火球，烤得池塘边暖乎乎的，圆圆的小荷叶圆圆荷站在水面上，晃着绿油油的大叶子。",
      "side": "narrator",
      "distanceClass": "distance-1"
    },
    {
      "domId": "story-p-1",
      "index": 1,
      "imageId": 2,
      "role": 2,
      "roleName": "叮叮蜓",
      "avatar": "https://kolka-assets.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/assets/admin/933e5ff6-fd12-40fa-a405-bfff0b9d062e/roles-2-avatar.png?OSSAccessKeyId=LTAI5tABYqhJrazkVYiNk8hM&Expires=1787370231&Signature=K5bDjs0misPdk1KSNWZXrySNh%2BI%3D",
      "startTime": 10680,
      "text": "哎呀太热啦，我的翅膀都要晒软啦！",
      "side": "left",
      "distanceClass": "distance-0"
    },
    {
      "domId": "story-p-2",
      "index": 2,
      "imageId": 2,
      "role": 0,
      "roleName": "旁白",
      "avatar": "https://kolka-assets.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/assets/admin/933e5ff6-fd12-40fa-a405-bfff0b9d062e/roles-0-avatar.png?OSSAccessKeyId=LTAI5tABYqhJrazkVYiNk8hM&Expires=1787370228&Signature=yGQObbZ6mKjN6%2F9ozEDLClpOBkU%3D",
      "startTime": 14904,
      "text": "小蜻蜓叮叮蜓扑着蓝翅膀飞得摇摇晃晃，圆圆荷赶紧挥了挥叶子喊它：",
      "side": "narrator",
      "distanceClass": "distance-1"
    },
    {
      "domId": "story-p-3",
      "index": 3,
      "imageId": 3,
      "role": 1,
      "roleName": "圆圆荷",
      "avatar": "https://kolka-assets.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/assets/admin/933e5ff6-fd12-40fa-a405-bfff0b9d062e/roles-1-avatar.png?OSSAccessKeyId=LTAI5tABYqhJrazkVYiNk8hM&Expires=1787370229&Signature=fyjPjPoSzPRbAZVo3NgdRDdnuB4%3D",
      "startTime": 23352,
      "text": "快到我叶子下面来呀，这里凉丝丝的！",
      "side": "right",
      "distanceClass": "distance-2"
    },
    {
      "domId": "story-p-4",
      "index": 4,
      "imageId": 4,
      "role": 0,
      "roleName": "旁白",
      "avatar": "https://kolka-assets.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/assets/admin/933e5ff6-fd12-40fa-a405-bfff0b9d062e/roles-0-avatar.png?OSSAccessKeyId=LTAI5tABYqhJrazkVYiNk8hM&Expires=1787370228&Signature=yGQObbZ6mKjN6%2F9ozEDLClpOBkU%3D",
      "startTime": 26928,
      "text": "叮叮蜓停在圆圆荷的叶片上，风一吹凉丝丝的，舒服得晃起了小脑袋。这时候，小青蛙呱呱蛙蹦得满头大汗跑了过来：",
      "side": "narrator",
      "distanceClass": "distance-3"
    },
    {
      "domId": "story-p-5",
      "index": 5,
      "imageId": 4,
      "role": 3,
      "roleName": "呱呱蛙",
      "avatar": "https://kolka-assets.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/assets/admin/933e5ff6-fd12-40fa-a405-bfff0b9d062e/roles-3-avatar.png?OSSAccessKeyId=LTAI5tABYqhJrazkVYiNk8hM&Expires=1787370231&Signature=f3cwR23PJs4%2B%2FVonQENdo7lOuqc%3D",
      "startTime": 40152,
      "text": "热死我啦热死我啦，有没有地方能躲躲太阳呀？",
      "side": "right",
      "distanceClass": "distance-3"
    },
    {
      "domId": "story-p-6",
      "index": 6,
      "imageId": 5,
      "role": 1,
      "roleName": "圆圆荷",
      "avatar": "https://kolka-assets.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/assets/admin/933e5ff6-fd12-40fa-a405-bfff0b9d062e/roles-1-avatar.png?OSSAccessKeyId=LTAI5tABYqhJrazkVYiNk8hM&Expires=1787370229&Signature=fyjPjPoSzPRbAZVo3NgdRDdnuB4%3D",
      "startTime": 46944,
      "text": "快蹲到我底下来呀，这里晒不到太阳！",
      "side": "right",
      "distanceClass": "distance-3"
    },
    {
      "domId": "story-p-7",
      "index": 7,
      "imageId": 6,
      "role": 0,
      "roleName": "旁白",
      "avatar": "https://kolka-assets.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/assets/admin/933e5ff6-fd12-40fa-a405-bfff0b9d062e/roles-0-avatar.png?OSSAccessKeyId=LTAI5tABYqhJrazkVYiNk8hM&Expires=1787370228&Signature=yGQObbZ6mKjN6%2F9ozEDLClpOBkU%3D",
      "startTime": 50976,
      "text": "呱呱蛙蹲在圆圆荷的阴影里，凉风吹过来，舒服得呱呱直叫。就在这时，穿着碎花裙的小朋友朵朵攥着小风车，满头大汗跑了过来：",
      "side": "narrator",
      "distanceClass": "distance-3"
    },
    {
      "domId": "story-p-8",
      "index": 8,
      "imageId": 6,
      "role": 4,
      "roleName": "朵朵",
      "avatar": "https://kolka-assets.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/assets/admin/933e5ff6-fd12-40fa-a405-bfff0b9d062e/roles-4-avatar.png?OSSAccessKeyId=LTAI5tABYqhJrazkVYiNk8hM&Expires=1787370232&Signature=IYj9sA8V5UElysJaSw40Oti9C58%3D",
      "startTime": 65400,
      "text": "哇，这里好凉快呀，我能和你们一起躲太阳吗？",
      "side": "left",
      "distanceClass": "distance-3"
    },
    {
      "domId": "story-p-9",
      "index": 9,
      "imageId": 7,
      "role": 1,
      "roleName": "圆圆荷",
      "avatar": "https://kolka-assets.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/assets/admin/933e5ff6-fd12-40fa-a405-bfff0b9d062e/roles-1-avatar.png?OSSAccessKeyId=LTAI5tABYqhJrazkVYiNk8hM&Expires=1787370229&Signature=fyjPjPoSzPRbAZVo3NgdRDdnuB4%3D",
      "startTime": 69720,
      "text": "当然可以呀，大家一起挤一挤更热闹！",
      "side": "right",
      "distanceClass": "distance-3"
    },
    {
      "domId": "story-p-10",
      "index": 10,
      "imageId": 7,
      "role": 0,
      "roleName": "旁白",
      "avatar": "https://kolka-assets.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/assets/admin/933e5ff6-fd12-40fa-a405-bfff0b9d062e/roles-0-avatar.png?OSSAccessKeyId=LTAI5tABYqhJrazkVYiNk8hM&Expires=1787370228&Signature=yGQObbZ6mKjN6%2F9ozEDLClpOBkU%3D",
      "startTime": 73704,
      "text": "小蜻蜓、小青蛙和朵朵挤在圆圆的荷叶阴影下，风一吹凉丝丝的，大家都笑啦。圆圆荷还告诉大家，夏天热的时候要躲在阴凉处，多喝温水，就不会中暑啦，大家都学会了避暑的小知识哦。",
      "side": "narrator",
      "distanceClass": "distance-3"
    }
  ],
